{title: 463 - Peace, Perfect Peace}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Bb]Peace, perfect peace,
[Eb/Bb]in this [Cm]dark [F/C]world [Bb]of [Dm/A]sin?
[Bb]The blood ofJesus
[Bb]whispers [Dm/A]peace [Adim]within.

Verse 2:
[Bb]Peace, perfect peace, [F/C]by thronging [Bb]duties pressed?
[Bb]To do the [Dm/A]will of [Adim]Jesus: this [Dm/F]is rest.

Verse 3:
[Bb]Peace, perfect peace, with [F/C]loved ones [Bb]far away?
[Bb]In Jesus' [Dm/A]keeping [Adim]we are safe, [Dm/F]and they.

Verse 4:
[Bb]Peace, perfect peace, [F/C]our future [Bb]all unknown?
[Bb]Jesus we [Dm/A]know, and [Adim]He is on [Dm/F]the throne.
